# HotDeploy Core Standards

- Read `AGENTS.md` and `CONTEXT.md` before domain or feature work (`CONTEXT.md` mandates [docs/COMMITS.md](docs/COMMITS.md) for commits and versioning).
- All committed artifacts in **English** (code, docs, UI, commits, PRs).
- API keys and secrets only in Rust keychain — never in React or git.
- Hostinger-first v1; provider logic stays in `src-tauri/`, not scattered in UI.
- Spec required before feature PR: `specs/features/NNN-*.spec.md`.
- Run `pnpm quality` before opening a PR.
- Do not create new markdown files unless listed in AGENTS.md §7 or explicitly requested.
- Use design tokens from `DESIGN.md` — no arbitrary Tailwind colors.
